= Trust Recommendations =

You nuke — Elemental Seal / Manafont / glass cannon. You need: Tank, **Refresh** (critical), Ballad, MP support.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — keeps mobs off you while you cast</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela">Arciela</a></strong></td><td>Haste + Refresh — Refresh is life for BLM</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Refresh on casters (you!), Slow/Distract reduce mob magic resist</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>Ballad stacks with Refresh, Elegy on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + Stun interrupts cover you mid-cast</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

